#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_slave.rst:5
msgid "Slave element"
msgstr "奴隶元素"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_slave.rst:7
msgid ""
"The slave elements represent the power circuit devices such the main "
"contacts from a power contactor. The slave elements also represent the "
"auxiliary contacts. Even if an auxiliary contactor is part of the command "
"circuit, its activation is forced by another element."
msgstr ""
"奴隶元件代表电源电路设备，如来自电源接触器的主要接触器。奴隶元件也代表辅助接触器，即使辅助接触器是指令电路的一部分，它的激活也由另一个元素强制。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_slave.rst:15
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech slave element"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech奴隶元素"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_slave.rst:17
msgid ""
"For slave element exist two type of variables, the general variables that "
"are common for all type of elements and managed internally by QElectroTech, "
"and the specific variables for this type of element."
msgstr "对于奴隶元素，存在两种类型的变量，即所有类型元素通用并由QEelectroTech内部管理的一般变量，以及这类元素的具体变量。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_slave.rst:21
msgid ""
"QElectroTech does not allow defining variable values for slave element. "
"QElectroTech does also not allows defining new variables. QElectroTech "
"allows only displaying the specific variables at dynamic texts."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech不允许定义奴隶元素的变量值。QEctroTech也不允许定义新的变量。QEctroTech只允许在动态文本中显示特定的变量。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_slave.rst:25
msgid "General variables"
msgstr "一般变量"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_slave.rst:27
msgid "**% {F}**: Label from the folio where the element can be found"
msgstr "**% {F}**:从可找到元素的圆柱处划出标签"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_slave.rst:28
msgid "**% {f}**: Number from the folio where the element can be found"
msgstr "**% {f}**:可以找到元素的光圈中的数字"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_slave.rst:29
msgid ""
"**% {M}**: Plant variable from the folio where the element can be found"
msgstr "**% {M}**:可以找到元素的圆柱形的植物变量"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_slave.rst:30
msgid ""
"**% {LM}**: Location variable of the folio where the element can be found"
msgstr "**% {LM}**:可以找到元素的光圈位置变量"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_slave.rst:31
msgid ""
"**% {l}**: Folio line number from the workspace where the element can be "
"found"
msgstr "**% {l}**:可以找到元素的工作空间的Folio行号"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_slave.rst:32
msgid ""
"**% {c}**: Folio column number from the workspace where the element can be "
"found"
msgstr "**% {c}**:可以找到元素的工作空间的Folio列号"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_slave.rst:33
msgid "**% {id}**: Folio position in the project (Schema number)"
msgstr "**% {id}**:项目中的Folio位置(计划编号)"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_slave.rst:35
msgid "Specific variables"
msgstr "具体变量"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_slave.rst:37
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**Position master element**: Internal pre-defined variable which is "
"automatically displayed under dynamic texts of the element. The default "
"formula from the variable is ``(%id-%l%c)``, variables took from master "
"element."
msgstr "**方案主元件**:在元素动态文本下自动显示的内部预定义变量。变量的默认公式是 ``(%id-%l%c)``,变量取自主元件。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_slave.rst:41
msgid ""
"The default formula from the **Position master element** and the position "
"where it should be displayed can be defined at cross references tab from "
"**New project** preferences."
msgstr "从 **投影母元素的默认公式** 和显示它的位置可以在 **新项目** 首选项的交叉引用标签中定义 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_slave.rst:46
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows also displaying the specific variables from the `Master "
"element <../../element/type/elementmaster.html>`_ at the dynamic text "
"fields."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 允许从 `主元件 <../../element/type/elementmaster.html>`_ 在动态文本字段中。"
